# Copy this file to .env and fill in the paths for your environment.
# .env is gitignored -- never commit it.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS
# ---------------
# The ShuttleSet data (clips, shuttle npy, rtmpose npy, collated arrays) is
# large and lives in different locations depending on where you are working:
#
#   - Local dev machine: data may not exist at all (tests use fake data)
#   - HPC (bourbaki / engelbart): data lives on a /scratch mount
#
# Rather than passing --clips-dir, --shuttle-npy-dir, etc. every time you run
# pipeline.data_access (or the collator / trainer), set them here once and they
# are picked up automatically. Shell exports always take precedence over this
# file, so you can still override on the fly if needed.
#
# HOW TO USE
# ----------
# 1. Copy this file:   cp .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in the paths below for your environment
# 3. Run normally:     python3.11 -m pipeline.data_access --summary
#
# POST-PHASE-2 LAYOUT NOTES
# -------------------------
# - BST_X_CLIPS_DIR still holds a nested tree: {split}/{Top,Bottom}_{stroke}/*.mp4.
# - BST_X_SHUTTLE_NPY_DIR is flat after Phase 2.2: {clip_stem}.npy directly.
# - BST_X_RTMPOSE_NPY_DIR is flat after Phase 2.1: {clip_stem}_joints.npy and
#   {clip_stem}_pos.npy directly. Leave blank until pose extraction has run.
# - BST_X_SHUTTLE_CSV_DIR holds the raw TrackNetV3 shuttle CSVs (collation input).
# - BST_X_CLIPS_CSV points at clips_master.csv (the post-Phase-2 source of
#   truth for split + taxonomy class per clip). Defaults to
#   <repo_root>/notebooks/clips_master.csv when unset.
# - BST_X_COLLATED_DATA_ROOT is the root holding the collated
#   ShuttleSet_data_<tax>/ dirs the trainer and inference read. Leave blank to
#   use the in-repo preparing_data/ default; set it to the /scratch mount on HPC.
#
# HPC PATHS (placeholder example; resolve the real mount on the node)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# BST_X_CLIPS_DIR=/scratch/<project>/ShuttleSet/clips
# BST_X_SHUTTLE_NPY_DIR=/scratch/<project>/ShuttleSet/shuttle_npy_flat
# BST_X_RTMPOSE_NPY_DIR=/scratch/<project>/ShuttleSet_keypoints_clean_sticky_anchor
# BST_X_SHUTTLE_CSV_DIR=/scratch/<project>/ShuttleSet/shuttle_csv
# BST_X_CLIPS_CSV=/home/<username>/badminton_cv_annotator/notebooks/clips_master.csv
# BST_X_COLLATED_DATA_ROOT=/scratch/<project>


# BST vars
BST_X_CLIPS_DIR=
BST_X_SHUTTLE_NPY_DIR=
BST_X_RTMPOSE_NPY_DIR=
BST_X_CLIPS_CSV=
BST_X_SHUTTLE_CSV_DIR=
BST_X_COLLATED_DATA_ROOT=
